:"2022-05-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"As Luis just highlighted, we had a tremendous quarter, and because of that, we are announcing that we are raising our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/13/duolingo-inc-duol-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2022 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2022-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"You're not going to see us doing layoffs or anything like that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/06/duolingo-inc-duol-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2022 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2022-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"This gives us the confidence to increase our full year guidance while remaining appropriately prudent given the current uncertainty in the macro environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/06/duolingo-inc-duol-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2022 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2022-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"For the full year 2022, we are increasing our guidance to $404 million to $410 million in total bookings, $361 million to $367 million in revenue and an adjusted EBITDA of positive $4 million to $7 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/06/duolingo-inc-duol-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2022 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2022-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"And because of that, we don't have to implement cost controls like layoffs or hiring freezes in order to achieve profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/duolingo-inc-duol-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2022 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2022-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"And as a result, we're raising our full-year guidance again.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/duolingo-inc-duol-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2022 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2022-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"And given our outperformance, we are raising our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/11/10/duolingo-inc-duol-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2022 Q4","e":"duol","d":"2023-02-28","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mario Lu","x":"But more recently, more traditional mobile games are implementing like a direct-to-consumer payment method.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/28/duolingo-duol-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2022 Q4","e":"duol","d":"2023-02-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"And in fact, based on strong conversion trends, we believe we have the opportunity to raise prices in some places and are experimenting with pricing as we speak.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/28/duolingo-duol-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q1","e":"duol","d":"2023-05-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mario Lu","x":"There's this new ruling from the Apple vs Android court case where apps can now go direct to consumer, if you will.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/duolingo-duol-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q1","e":"duol","d":"2023-05-09","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Mario Lu","x":"I guess what is Duolingo's strategy in terms of potentially going to direct-to-consumer and kind of expanding gross margins out of it?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/duolingo-duol-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q1","e":"duol","d":"2023-05-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"And for the full year 2023, we are raising our guidance to $552 million to $561 million in total bookings, $500 million to $509 million in total revenue, and we are updating our adjusted EBITDA margin range from 11% to 12%, which reflects an incremental margin of about 32%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/duolingo-duol-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q1","e":"duol","d":"2023-05-09","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"This quarter's shareholder letter focuses on how well the recent advances in generative AI complement our existing competitive advantages like our data moat, our beloved brand, and our unique way of teaching.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/10/duolingo-duol-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2023-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mario Lu","x":"I was just curious to share your thoughts on just Duolingo's pricing power overall and the thought of increasing pricing on the core products and synergies going forward as we have seen from other kind of consumer mobile apps.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/duolingo-duol-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2023-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"And then when you talk about pricing power, I think it goes back to what we've said a bunch of times on these calls, which is we experiment with price and packaging a lot around the world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/duolingo-duol-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2023-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"Based on our strong results and trends, we are raising our full year guidance and issuing the following for Q3 2023: $136.5 million to $139.5 million in total bookings; $129.5 million to $132.5 million in revenue; and an adjusted EBITDA margin of 13% to 14%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/duolingo-duol-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2023-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"For the full year 2023, we are raising our guidance to $569 million to $575 million in total bookings, $510 million to $515 million in revenue, and we are updating our adjusted EBITDA margin range to 14% to 15%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/09/duolingo-duol-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2023-11-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"So, we'll experiment with raising prices over time as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/08/duolingo-duol-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2023-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"…and had impressive user bookings and revenue growth. and it was a fun Quarter 2 with the Barbie campaign and also preparing for our Best We also feel very good about the coming quarter, which is why we're raising our full year guidance to now reflect 40% year-over-year bookings growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/08/duolingo-duol-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2023-11-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"Based on our strong results and the trends we're seeing so far, we feel confident about raising our full year outlook, issuing the following Q4 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/11/08/duolingo-duol-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q4","e":"duol","d":"2024-02-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Boone","x":"But what about the opportunity to just take price within the U.S., right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/28/duolingo-duol-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q4","e":"duol","d":"2024-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"The press reported that we did layoffs based on AI, that is actually not what happened.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/28/duolingo-duol-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2023 Q4","e":"duol","d":"2024-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"We did reduce our contractor force, but this was not like full-time employee layoffs or anything like that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/28/duolingo-duol-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2024 Q1","e":"duol","d":"2024-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"We're also improving our family plan experience by streamlining the invite flow and having more engaging social features.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/duolingo-duol-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2024 Q1","e":"duol","d":"2024-05-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"Our progress on these initiatives, alongside other monetization initiatives on our current trends, give us the confidence to raise our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/duolingo-duol-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2024 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2024-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"For the full year, we are raising our guidance so that at the midpoint, we are guiding to year-over-year bookings and revenue growth of about 32.5% and 38.5%, respectively.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/duolingo-duol-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2024 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2024-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Arvind Ramnani","x":"And you raised guidance for the year, I get it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/duolingo-duol-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2024 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2024-08-07","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Mark Mahaney","x":"And there are companies -- I mean, people so focused on how AI could disrupt Duolingo and there's not enough focus on how you're using AI and how you could use it in the future to create just dramatically more engaging content, like it's not like you haven't been involved with AI for a long…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/duolingo-duol-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2024 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2024-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Debbie Belevan","x":"Since we did so well and we feel good about next quarter, we're raising our full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/duolingo-duol-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2024 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2024-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"Looking ahead, we're raising full year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/duolingo-duol-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2024 Q4","e":"duol","d":"2025-02-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"The first is our investment in AI and automation that Luis and I had mentioned, which we expect to become more efficient throughout the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/27/duolingo-duol-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2024 Q4","e":"duol","d":"2025-02-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"But we are currently expecting Q2 adjusted EBITDA margin to be approximately two points lower than Q1 with meaningful margin expansion in Q3 and Q4 as we realize AI cost efficiencies and as our marketing spend as a percent of revenue comes down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/27/duolingo-duol-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2025 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2025-08-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"So we raised prices, and that had a small impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/duolingo-duol-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2025 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2025-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Kuntarich","x":"Kind of benefits from AI cost savings versus potentially any of that flow any of the web-based checkout flowing through the gross margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/duolingo-duol-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2025 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2025-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"As a result, we're raising our full-year guidance again while still investing in both our core business and exciting new areas like chess, math, and music that we believe will drive long-term growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/06/duolingo-duol-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2025 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Miguel Arounian","x":"And then, maybe another broad one on AI and can you just talk about what you're seeing around compute costs, gross margins coming in a little better than expected?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/duolingo-duol-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2025 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Luis von Ahn","x":"You know, in terms of price increases, you'll see us we'll be testing prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/duolingo-duol-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2025 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Skaruppa","x":"One is, you know, we've talked a lot about taking price up as a price point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/duolingo-duol-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2026 Q1","e":"duol","d":"2026-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Gilian Munson","x":"The prior-year quarter included the initial rollout of energy, a price increase on our most popular subscription plan, and exceptional advertising performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/duolingo-duol-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2026 Q1","e":"duol","d":"2026-05-04","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Bryan Michael Smilek","x":"Or how should we think about the product-market, go-to-market approach on Max now that AI is becoming more—not commoditized—but more available across the broader ecosystem?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/duolingo-duol-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2026 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Ygal Arounian","x":"And then I want to come back to the comments you made about the open source models and how that's driven down AI compute cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/duolingo-duol-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2026 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gilian Munson","x":"For gross margin, we now expect to end the year closer to 70% as compared to the 69% we initially expected as we drive more AI content into our products offset by AI cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/duolingo-duol-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2026 Q2","e":"duol","d":"2026-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gilian Munson","x":"What we're basically saying is by going up about 1.5 points on that adjusted EBITDA margin, we are seeing AI cost savings that will give us a bit structurally a better margin even with our goal to put voice call out to all Super users over the course of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/duolingo-duol-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DUOL 2026 Q3","e":"duol","d":"2026-11-03","l